direction: right
requirements: Requirements
constraints: Constraints
rule: Deterministic rule
model: LLM call
verify: Verify (schema / tests)
publish: Publish
qa: QA evaluator
requirements -> constraints: write down
constraints -> rule: rule first
constraints -> model: only where judgment needed
model -> verify: output
verify -> model: retry + repair
verify -> publish: pass
rule -> publish
publish -> qa: evaluate
qa -> requirements: P0 found
